<p><a href="http://scp-sandbox-3.wikidot.com/retrom">http://scp-sandbox-3.wikidot.com/retrom</a></p>
<p>The story of a lonely SCP and the doctor who became his friend.</p>
<p>It's the first time I write on here, so actually pretty much any advice or critique would help me improve it so I can post it eventually, but I would really like help about the formatting of the page, the structure of my story elements and dialogue tips as well.</p>
<p>The title came from Grigori Karpin as I have really no other idea for a title, so if someone has something else, it could be nice.</p>
<p>Also, here's the link to my greenlight : <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-13816271">http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-13816271</a> and it is in my sandbox as well.</p>
<p>The article is 2,245 words long and it's important to note that there is a bit of violence (self-harm) in the incident report addendum.</p>
<p>Hope you (the kind reviewer who sees this) like it and merry christmas in advance.</p>

